    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR3j0015-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-09T18:19:33.299+09:00">The ruler </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-09T18:20:22.557+09:00">he is the one who is deemed capable insofar as he is capable of employing people;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-09T18:48:37.358+09:00">and as for the commoner he is deemed capable insofar as he is capable of doing things himself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-09T18:59:32.614+09:00">If officials and dignitaries, within to their separaate duties follow their instructions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-09T19:00:36.594+09:00">the feudal lord rulers, in accordance with their different territories, take care of their obligations</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-09T19:04:03.364+09:00">and the Three Dukes , comprehensively debate overall issues regarding all regions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-09T19:49:48.397+09:00">then the Son of Heaven, hands down, will put things right."  </seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
